\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De profectu in vita spirituali}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Notandum est monacho volenti proficere\u8249 \'8b in vita spirituali}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  et deo servire in monasterio plura sunt necessaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 est clara et perfecta noticia suorum defectuum et infirmitatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 abominatio et nichillatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (!). 9 Anforderungen (wie Uppsala UB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 C 461}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Andersson-Schmitt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hallberg/Hedlund\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  S. 168; mit 15 Anforderungen \u252 \'fcberliefert in Trier StB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Hs. 1935/1432 4\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Bushey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  S. 221).
