\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Ludolphus de Saxonia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Vita Jesu Christi}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Ausz\u252 \'fcge Pars 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , c. 85. 89. 51. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Nota de laude divina. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 O anima mea. Inmensa (!) quippe\u8249 \'8b creatoris et conditoris tui beneficia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 collata sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 liberius de sua morte et passione etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Explicit ipsa die s. Dorothee 1492}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (6. Feb. 1492).  Ed.: A. C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Bolard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 /\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  L. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Rigollot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  / J. B.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Carnandet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Vita Jesu Christi \u8230 \'85 per Ludolphum de Saxonia, 1865, (ND 2006 = Analecta Cartusiana 241) S. 755-758, 774-777, 570-572. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hain\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 10290-10296. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  RB 3,5437.}

