\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Meditationes canonicae secundum arborem vitae crucifixae Jesu Ubertini de Casali}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur exposicio seu declaracio versiculorum prescriptorum in hunc modum. Et primo feria secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Recordare misterium sancte trinitatis \u8230 \'85 Text: \u8250 \'9bJhesus ex patre genitus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Dum Jhesum audis ex deo genitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 de cuius plenitudine nos omnes accepimus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit feria 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  post dominicam Estomichi anno domini 1492 per fratrem Wilhelmum Wittwer professum huius monasterii anno ingressionis sue vicesimo tercio qui intravit monasterium sanctorum Udalrici et Affre anno domini et ipsa die sanctorum apostolorum Symonis et Iude idque quinto Kalendas novembris anno gracie 1469 et predictum festum erat illo anno die sabbati. Abbas huius loci tunc temporis erat dominus Melchior de Stamhaim vir nobilis genere sciencia et sapiencia cuius anima requiescat in pace Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. Weiterer Schreibervermerk \u252 \'fcber den gesamten Text verstreut (jeweils rot am Abschnittsende): (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1492\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 fr\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ater\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1492\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 W\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ilhelmus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 W\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ittwer\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 de Ho\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 steten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 professus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 monasterii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 V\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dalrici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et Affre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) im Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Magdalene sororis utinam mei\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Abschrift der Kapitelanf\u228 \'e4nge, verteilt auf 3 quinquagenae bzw. 7 Tage. Druck des ungek\u252 \'fcrzten Werks: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hain \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 4551. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , RB 3,3582. 
