\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Ludolphus de Saxonia}}\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 :\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De vita Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Ausz\u252 \'fcge. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Secuntur nunc oraciones devote de passione domini nostri Jhesu Christi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 O bone Jhesu\u8249 \'8b totus mundus videtur contra te coniurasse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 -\u8230 \'85 (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Expliciunt oraciones ex 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  parte Vita\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 e\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Christi per fratrem Wilhelmum Wittwer feria 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  post dominicam Judica idque 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ydus apprilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (10. April) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 sive ante festum sanctorum Tyburcii et Valeriani quod festum fuit sabbato Palmarum anno domini 1492. Et feria 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 post eandem dominicam dux Jeorius Baioariorum venit cum magno apparatu ad Augustam occurrente ei rege Maximiliano usque ad pontem Lici fluminis et sicut honorifice fuit susceptus a rege et omnibus Augustensibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. Weiterer Schreibervermerk u. Wetternotiz: (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Nota quod ego frater Wilhelmus Wittwer scripsi istud ergo folium infra 2a et 3a hora idque 5to kalendas aprilis (28. M\u228 \'e4rz) sive in octava sancti Benedicti cecidit pluvia utilis summa (?) et postea tonitrua audita sunt prima illius anni scil. 1492}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. Es handelt sich um die Schlu\u223 \'dfgebete sowie weitere kurze Exzerpte aus pars 2 c. 51-89. Ed. (s.o. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) S. 572-777. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer bis auf (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Nota zu ambitus.}

