\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Breviarium caeremoniarum monasterii Mellicensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Pars I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Capitulatio \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Tabula capitulorum partis operis sequentis 147\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  feria ante Nicolai etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b, (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  in breviarium ceremoniarum monasterii Mellicensis ducatus Austriae Pataviensis diocesis anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  XVIII per venerabiles patres monasteriorum Sublacensis et Sacri Specus auctoritate domini Martini pape quinti reformati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quamvis beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti regulam sufficientissime}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85, (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De sono ad collacionem capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Omni itaque tempore quando bis manducatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit prima pars huius operis feria 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ante festum conversionis Pauli anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 47 quinto etc. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85(25. Jan. 1475). \u8213 \'af (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Pars II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Capitulatio, (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text, (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit secunda pars huius operis ipsa die Blasii episcopi et martiris anno domini 1475\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Zus\u228 \'e4tzliches Kapitel:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9bDe processionibus et prosis sive sequenciis capitulum 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCM 2 S. 247 f. c. LXXIII\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 . \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Pars III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Capitulatio, (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text mit 2 zus\u228 \'e4tzlichen Kapiteln: (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De casibus reservatis c. 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCM 2 S. 235 c. XXXII, (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De absolucionibus et benediccionibus nocturnalibus c. 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Explicit 3a pars huius operis ante reminiscere anno domini 1475to per me Wilhelmum Wittwer de Hoechstatt professum huius monasterii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 CCM \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 2 S. 7-191. 
