\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -325\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Missa s. Bonifatii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Prolog (ostschw\u228 \'e4bisch u. lat.): \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Sant Bonifacius der wa\u223 \'df kranck bi\u223 \'df auff den tod}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  und pat got da\u223 \'df er im verlich lenger ze leben hie auff erden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b, (323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sanctus Bonifacius egrotavit usque ad mortem, petens a domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b, (324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipit missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Introitus\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Humiliavit se ipse dominus nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Jhesus Christus usque ad mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Messe S. 158 f.
