\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -346\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Nachtr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  verschiedener H\u228 \'e4nde, datiert 1486-1506. (337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) notae de liturgia, (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) litterae (Abschriften), (340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Wilhelmus Wittwer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Metra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Metra de missali \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Millequadringentos annos dominus concesse fiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  annos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit 1491\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Metra de episcopo Augustensi Johanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  [de Giltlingen]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ex Werdenberga comitum de gente Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Novem sunt chori angelorum versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angelusque primus archangelus ordo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, notae de numeris, (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) formae praesentandi ad ordines, (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) formae litterarum (anonymisiert), (344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) notae de liturgia. }

