\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -80\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Meditationes de vita Christi}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Prohemium in meditationem vite domini Jhesu Christi. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Apostolus Paulus ad Galathas (2,19)\u8249 \'8b Inter cetera scribens dicit: Christo confixus sum \u8230 \'85 Ex quibus apostoli verbis edocemur quam optimum sit homini }}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 atque sic loquendo nichil utilius esse poterit quam se occupare cum vita Christi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ut aliqualis simplex sequitur modus contritionis etc\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (7\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Contricio aliqualis\u8249 \'8b Abeant igitur: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Coram te domine deus meus in oblivionem mea tempora male consumpta}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  nosque salva meritis matris Jhesu Christi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (80\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Besitzeintrag (von anderer Hand): \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Frater Georgius Mayr me sibi vendicat 1579 23 decembris. NB.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Individuelle Zusammenstellung verschiedener Andachten und Gebete (de passione domini, de gaudiis BMV, de compassione BMV), mit kurzen Meditationsanweisungen. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  81\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -87\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. }

