\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 89\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -104\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Bonaventura}}\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 :\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Epistola vigintiquinque memorialium}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Prolog: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 In Christo suo dilecto Bonaventura de Balneo Regio confratri eius in domino. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Qualicumque homine veteri exuto \u8230 \'85 (93r) Text: Sunt ergo quedam virtutes}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 devotis tuis oracionibus commendabis cui est honor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Amen. Finis regule in Christo vivere volencium sive epistole sancti Bonaventure.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Leicht verk\u252 \'fcrzt gegen\u252 \'fcber Druck: Opera omnia 8, Quaracchi 1898 S. 491-498. Zum Text: \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Glorieux\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2, 305 ac; \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Distelbrink\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Bonaventurae scripta S. 42 f. Nr. 42. \endash  88\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .105\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -108\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

