\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Meditationes de passione domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De modo exercitandi se in passione domini per totam diem et noctem etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Si religiosus est surgens ad matutinas in nocte hic est sibi modus servandus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De sero quando ire voluerit dormitum. Cogitet de cena domini quando dominus venit ad locum cenaculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85(125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 unde in honore huius articuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Et sic finita passione domini omni die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Zusatz: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Si quis non surget ad matutinas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Qui autem non surgunt ad matutinas debent nichil de sero incipere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 de eius iniunctione et sepultura. Et sic adest finis. Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \endash  126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Passionsgebete: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 O domine Jhesu Christe fili dei vivi (126v) pone passionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  crucem et mortem tuam inter extremum iudicium tuum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Gratias ago tibi o dulcissime domine Jhesu Christe pro universis vulneribus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  doloribus et iniuriis innocentissime passionis et mortis tue \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Besitzvermerk (von anderer Hand): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Frater Georgius Mayer me sibi vendicat 1579 23 decembris. NB.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

