\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Caeremoniae monasterii ss. Udalrici et Afrae secundum usum monasterii Mellicensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Ausz\u252 \'fcge u.a. aus den Melker consuetudines, mit spezifischen Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen f\u252 \'fcr den Gebrauch in St. Ulrich u. Afra. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hic infra descriptum est officium seu ministerium accollitorum iuxta practicam et consuetudinem monasterii Melicensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ordinis sancti Benedicti etc. De generali ministracione diaconi est notandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quando sacerdos celebraturus missam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De generali ministracione subdiaconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De officio primi accolliti generale ad vesperas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Accolliti grece ceroferarii dicuntur latine vnde eius officium est preparare luminaria et ipsa portare coram ministris altaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de processione, (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de officio primi accoliti, (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Einschub: Dispens von Fastengeboten (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 frater Georgius Winter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ), Fastenversprechen des \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 frater Georgius Winter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 isto tempore pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De officio candelarii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b, (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Finitum ultima die apprilis anno domini 1512\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Text der caeremoniae h\u228 \'e4ufig stark abweichend von der Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCM 2 S. 206 ff. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Nachtrag von anderer Hand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De festo omnium sanctorum\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Aufgaben des accolitus primus). \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Weitere Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus den Caeremoniae: (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) mandatum hospitum, (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) in festivitatibus (in conversione s. Pauli \endash  festum s. Mathiae), mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen des Abtes von St. Ulrich u. Afra von 1493/94, (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Einschub: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quid agatur pro fratribus conventualibus defunctis in communi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCM 2 S. 217-220, (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) in festivitatibus (Gregorii papae \endash  in nativitate s. Johannis Baptistae), Text bricht am Seitenende ab. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1   69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

