\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Excerpta ex libro Honorii philozophi atque solitarii qui liber clavis phisice dicitur. 1526. Ex prologo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quibusdam minus ratione exercitatis videbuntur scripta mea absona \u8230 \'85, Text: \u8250 \'9bDiscipulus\u8249 \'8b Propositis tibi a me aliquando quibusdam questionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , causabaris tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1   \u8230 \'85, (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) 2. Teil: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sana et ecclesiastica doctrina firmissime credit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ut in lumine sancti spiritus lumen patrem videamus. Magister. Fiat fiat. Finis huius Egregie Collecture ex Honorio per fratrem Erasmum H\plain \f4\i\lang1024\fs22\cf1 \u367 \'f9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ber Athesinum monachum et presbiterum professumque huius incliti monasterii sanctorum \plain \f4\i\lang1024\fs22\cf1 \u366 \'d9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 dalrici et Affre Auguste Anno 1532. In die sanctorum Johannis et Pauli Ingressionis sue ad religionem Anno 41. Sit dominus deus benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. fiat fiat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Teils ausf\u252 \'fchrliche und w\u246 \'f6rtliche, teils stark verk\u252 \'fcrzende und paraphrasierende Ausz\u252 \'fcge, viele Kapitel ganz ausgelassen; Ed. (nur 1. Teil): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 P. Lucentini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Studi e testi 21) 1974 S. 3-266. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sch\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 nberger\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1  Nr. 13921. \u8213 \'af 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

