\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Benedictio super infirmum, (3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) praeparatio ad confessionem, (4\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ante sacram communionem, (6\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) dispositio ad extremam unctionem, (10\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) pia suspiria (Gebete), (38\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ad impetrandam patientiam, (60\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) protestatio contra omnes malignos incursus, (61\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitium variarum virtutum per quaestiones, (69\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) piae adhortationes ad felicem mortem, (89\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) quando aegroto porrigitur lumen, (96\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) quando anima egressura est de corpore, (99\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) benedictiones super infirmos, (102\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Schreibervermerk:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Ad Maiorem Dei gloriam et honorem sine macula conceptae virginis Mariae et Sancti Patris mei Francisci. Conscripta a Patre Anacleto Kegler Passavii A\u176 \'b0 M. DCCIV}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (103\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) pro pusillanimitate, (120\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) procrastinatio conversionis infirmi, (123\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) reconciliatio cum inimicis, (128\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) condonatio iniuriarum, (133\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) impatientia propter dolores, (137\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) pro amatoribus huius immundi mundi, (138\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) formulae absolutionis, (144\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) casus summo pontifici reservati, (147\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) casus episcopales in diocesi Passaviensi, Herbipolensi, Bambergensi, Salisburgensi, Augustana, (149\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) casus in ordine seraphico. }

