\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -584\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Clemens Sender}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Armarius animae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Cogitanti mihi pater Reverende ubi aliquid ocii superest}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  quod dignum t.r.p. offerre valerem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Caput 1. De bonitate dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (\u220 \'dcberschrift von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand). Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Cum illa sempiterna divina et super benedicta ac semper benedicenda trinitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  unaquaque individua et inseparabilis unitas, unus sit ut ait Augustinus in primo libro de trinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ostende tuis famulis premia post laborem. Sic ergo finiatur noster armarius anime ut laudat deum omnis spiritus. \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (549\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit Armarius anime in die Onoffrii almi confessoris Christi. Editus et conscriptus per me fratrem Clementem Sender de Laugingen cenobitam sanctorum Udalrici et Afre Vindelice in monasterio Ursinensi. Ad laudem et gloriam gloriose virginis Marie ac predictorum sanctorum Anno salutis 1517. Deo igitur laus sit et honor qui deduxit placide quassatum calamum ad portum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (553\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Alphabetischer Index (mit Blattverweisen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Annotatio notabilium dictorum iuxta alphabeticum ordinem huius armarii anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (584\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Finis tabule alphabetice 1517\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Das Werk bietet eine Zusammenstellung der \u8222 \'84\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 arma lucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \ldblquote  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) im Kampf gegen die \u8222 \'84\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 vicia et animi morbi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \ldblquote  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ); keine Kapiteleinteilung oder \u220 \'dcberschriften, eine kleine Orientierungshilfe bietet der Index. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (550\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Dicta (aus Isidor, Libri sententiarum) und Vers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Terra iacet stabilis, aqua fluit labilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1  \u8213 \'af 550\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -552\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  u. 584\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -589\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. }

