\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Synopsis psalmorum ad quotidianum precandi usum comparata ex triplici translatione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Vulgata quae LXX versioni respondet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Pagnimontana quae cum Haebraico textu convenire dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Latina ex Iohannis Campensis Versione desumpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Synopse ausgew\u228 \'e4hlter Psalmverse in 3 lateinischen Fassungen: (Sp.1) Vulgata, (Sp. 2) Hebraica = Biblia hebraica eorundem latina interpretatio Xantis Pagnini Lucensis, Benedicti Ariae Montani Hispalensis \u8230 \'85 collato studio ad Hebraicam dictionem diligentissime expensa, Antwerpen 1572, (Sp. 3) Latina = Psalmorum ad hebraicam veritatem versio latina, Druck: Jan van Campen, Enchiridion psalmorum, Lyon 1540 / Basel 1548. Aufteilung der Psalmverse in 54 Abschnitte, Gruppierung nach Funktionen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Introi\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 tus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ad laud\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ationem\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 G\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ratiarum\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 A\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ctio\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 OBS\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ecratio\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ad post\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ulationem\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ad ora\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 tionem\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ad interp\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ellationem\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . }

