\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Titelblatt und Inhaltsverzeichnis (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Altera pars ecclesiasticarum concionum autore f\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ratre\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Chaspare Heroaldo Geroltzhovense minorita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, darunter (in Kreuzform) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 f\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 rater\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  d\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ominus?\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  C\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 aspar\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  H\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 erolt\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  M\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 inorita\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  A\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 rgentinensis?\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Qui aliorum salutem sitit seipsum inculpatum custodiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hexastichon f\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ratris\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Chasparis Herolt minorite Geroltzhovensis ad servatorem nostrum Christum Jhesum. Tu mea Christe salus\u8249 \'8b spes atque redemptio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 queso tuum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Widmung und Vers identisch mit M\u252 \'fcnchen UB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 14}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  und M\u252 \'fcnchen BSB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Clm 9063}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Verzeichnis von Augustinusbriefen, geordnet nach Predigtthemen. (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Verzeichnis der enthaltenen Predigten (bricht nach der 2. Predigt ab). \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

