\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Meditationes paraphrasticae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 in psalmos septem vulgo poenitentiales nuncupatos. Cum adscripta ad marginem vulgata editione et paraphrasi iuxta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 brevi et perspicua I\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ohannis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 C\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ampensis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  nec non duplici argumento cuiusque psalmi G\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ilberto\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 G\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 enebrardo\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  et I\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ohanne\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 H\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 entensio?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  autoribus et paucis notis ex variis desumptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 6, (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 31, (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 37, (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 50, (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 101, (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 129, (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 142, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Finis VII Psal\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 morum\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  poenitentialium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Index addititiorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 psalmorum,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 90, (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 110, (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 102, (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 148, (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 91, (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 24, (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 33, (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 85. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Grundlage der Meditationes sind in der Spalte links neben dem Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 T\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 extus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 V\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ulgatae\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 E\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ditionis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (= Psalterium Gallicanum), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 J\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ohannis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 C\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ampensis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 P\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 araphrasis?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (= Psalmorum omnium iuxta Hebraicam veritatem paraphrastica interpretatio authore Joanne Campensi, Druck N\u252 \'fcrnberg 1532/1533, VD 16: B 3149/3154), sowie (von gleicher Hand nachgetragen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 H\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ebraica\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 A\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 uctorum?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 V\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ariorum?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ; Text sehr \u228 \'e4hnlich: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 8\u176 \'b0 Cod 217}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (gemeinsame Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr 8\u176 \'b0 Cod 90 u. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Cod 217}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ist zu vermuten, aber n.n.).\plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1  \u8213 \'af (239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Franciscus dux Guisiae: Oratio (1563), (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Orationes.}

