\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Petrus de Rosenheim}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Rosarium bibliae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Prologe: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 1486\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Reverendo in Christo patri domino Brande \u8230 \'85 Multi conati sunt }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85, (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Prologus metricus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Rore tuo cor Christe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85, (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Canones: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sicut ex iniuncto accepi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Einschub: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Metra patris Ioannis Slitpacher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Includit puto biblia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia carminum 9255. (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tabula der B\u252 \'fccher und Kapitelzahl, (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Per hos versus epilogus cognoscitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Astra polum iuncta terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85, (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit vetus testamentum. Sequitur novum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85, (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 1486\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b, (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sacre scripture cui sit benescribere cure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Unterer Blattrand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 F\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 rater\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  L\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 eonardus\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  feria 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  post Benedicti 1486 finitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af Abfolge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  wie bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  RB 4,6836. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  13988-13991. Zu Verfasser u. Werk \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 VL 7, Sp. 519 (H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Rosenfeld\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) V\u228 \'e4ter-Dicta. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  leer.}

