\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Libellus caeremoniarum monasterii Mellicensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit libellus ceremoniarum monasterii Mellicensis qui ostensus et perlectus in congregacione patrum ordinis simul congregatorum in Salczburga de omnibus dyocesibus ac monasteriis sic infra patebit et hec sub anno domini 1470 in die sancti Augustini episcopi et doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (28. Aug.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Capitulatio pars I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit prologus in breviarium ceremoniarum monasterii Mellicensis ducatus Austrie Pataviensis diocesis anno domini 1418 per venerabiles patres monasterii Sublacensis et Sacri Specus auctoritate domini Martini pape quinti reformati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b, Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quamvis beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti regulam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sufficientissime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85, (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit prima pars huius operis feria 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  infra octavam nativitatis Marie anno 1494\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (12. Sept. 1494). \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Pars II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Capitulatio, (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Text, (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit pars secunda huius operis die sancti Lamberti episcopi et martiris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (17. Sept. 1494) \u8230 \'85,  (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Pars III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : capitulatio, (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Text \u8230 \'85, (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Expliciunt tres partes statutorum sive ceremonialium regularis observancie etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\u8249 \'8b. Y-Text der Melker Consuetudines, s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , CCM 1 S. CVII. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Einschub: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De inclinacionibus discoopercionibus genuflexionibus et reliquis ceremoniis quottidianis in quibus novicii primum sunt instituendi ac communiter ab omnibus sunt observanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Inclinaciones in officio divino profunde scil. in tantum quod manus possent tangere genua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 Exzerpte aus verschiedenen Texten der Sublacenser Observanz, s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  CCM 1 S. CIX-CX.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22  \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt ceremonie que ad accolitos candelarios et ceroferarios in suis officiis et ministeriis respiciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Pulsato primo signo ad vesperas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Et sic est finis de officiis ac ministeriis accolitorum candelariorum ac ceroferariorum iuxta certam practicam et consuetudinem nostri monasterii Mellicensis 1494 in profesto sancte Elisabeth lantgravie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (18. Nov. 1494)\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Hec sunt festa duplicia maiora in quibus aut dominus abbas cantare solet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nativitas domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Expliciunt ceremonie 1494 in vigilia sancte Cecilie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (21. Nov. 1494)\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  CCM 2 S. 7-220 (diese Hs U\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). }

