g1033\fs22\cf1  (Name geschw\u228 \'e4rzt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 di Augusta Anno 1562\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , von anderer Hand (16. Jh.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 a.m.w. Me et te sola mors separabit\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 . \u8213 \'af I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

