\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Bartholomaeus de Sancta Sophia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Practica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Tractatus super nono Almansoris, Ausz\u252 \'fcge). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Aliqua excerpta ex practica Bartholomei de Sancta Sophia incepta anno 92 quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 feria post euzabii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 In dolore capitis a sanguine creato}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 cerota, suffimigia et similes medicine. Et hec sufficiant ad laudem dei omnipotentis eiusque matris virginis Marie et totius curie triumphantis excerpta per Ma\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 \u225 \'e1\u241 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Tho\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 \u225 \'e1\u241 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 et finita anno 1493 in vigilia palmarum Ingolstat. Et sunt recepte excellentis artium et medicine doctoris ac famati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 practici magistri Bartholomei de Sancta Sophia collecte et pronunciate per eundem Padue et rescripte per quendam scholarem anno 1439. Et magister Bartholomeus erat in vita 1439 et erat annorum 88 etc. Est ergo practica nova etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Zum Autor: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 T. Pesenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Professori e promotori di medicina nello studio di Padova dal 1405-1509, Padua 1984 (Contributi alla storia dell\rquote Universit\u224 \'e0 di Padova 16) S. 177 f., zu Werk u. \u220 \'dcberlieferung ebd. S. 179 f.}

