\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1  Approbatio}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f3\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ianuae artis\plain \f3\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Approbatio libelli Rome per iudices infra a Papa Sixto assignatos\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Beatissime pater, post pedum oscula beatorum. Sepe filius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (lies: fuimus)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  cum magistro Petro Dagi ut audiremus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (lies: videremus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) intellectum quem tractatui edito \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Guilhelmus Bodovit. Hyspali inpressum anno 1491\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Abschrift vom Druck Sevilla 1491 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Rogent/Dur\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Nr. 13; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  8150). Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 J. Monfasani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Fernando of Cordova. A biographical and Intellectual Profile in: Transactions of the American Philosophical Society 82,6 1992, App. 10 S. 95-99, zu den Hintergr\u252 \'fcnden der Approbatio ebd. S. 51 f. }

