\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Liber de articulis fidei}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Aedificatio salutiferae legis)\plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Edificatio salutifere legis omnes ceteras improbans, articulos fidei christianae per necessarias propositiones demonstrative probando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Introductio (Verse): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hic demonstratur veritas/ articulorum fidei/ Quam non facit auctoritas/ sed quia est et quid rei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 propicietur venia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (36 Verse). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Deus in virtute tua sperantes et de tua gracia confidentes intendimus probare articulos fidei per necessarias rationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Ad probacionem articulorum fidei accedentes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 quod arma clericorum sunt armis eorum nobiliora et eciam forciora. Ex Lugduno ultimate in Augusto data ac anno 1512 transscripta. \u8250 \'9b1512 R\u8729 \'b7S\u8729 \'b7M\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Vermutlich Abschrift vom undatierten anonymen Druck GW 262 (Lyon?, nach 1500?). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ller RB 5,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 7156-2; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sch\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 neberger\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1  Nr. 17179. \u8213 \'af 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

