\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Exercitium quotidianum boni religiosi, (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) meditationes de vita Christi, datiert: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 MDCXXI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) mysteria vitae Christi, (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) colloquium pium animae fidelis cum Christo, (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de novem transitis Christi in passione; Datierung 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 laus deo MDCXXI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) modus vesperi incumbendi, (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitationes matutinae, (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitia ad angelum custodem, (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de meditatione spirituali (Bezug auf \u8218 \'82Rosetum\rquote  des Johannes Mauburnus), (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) meditationes quotidianae \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Die dominico. De humilitate Christi. Primo igitur cogitabis, quanta humilitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Douai, Biblioth\u232 \'e8que municipale Cod 520,56 CGMBP 6, S. 313), (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitia horarum, (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) examen particulare et quotidianum, (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) examen conscientiae, (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) modus accedendi ad ss. eucharistiam, (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) materia examinis particularis, (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) examen conscientiae omnibus beatae virginis Mariae sodalibus quotidie faciendum, (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitium \u8230 \'85 contra insidias diaboli \u8230 \'85 (Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus: Thomas a Kempis, Hospitale pauperum vol. 4 c. 18-19), (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) preces, (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de missa audienda, (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) mysteria rosarii, (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) in vita Christi consideranda, (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ratio perveniendi ad perfectionem monasticam, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitium ad refectionem regularem, (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) regulae aliquot ad victum recte temperandum, (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) documenta quaedam ad recte meditandum et orandum, (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) meditationes per adventum domini, (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) in nativitate, (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de nativitate Christi, (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) de modo bene celebrandi octavam corporis Christi, (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) contemplatio ad amorem spiritualem in nobis excitandum (Bezug auf Thomas a Kempis, Liber de imitatione Christi), (251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) dispositio ad eucharistiam, (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) modus deum orandi, (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) brevis explicatio orationis dominicae, (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ordo horarum, (272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) constitutiones diariae (Kurze Ausz\u252 \'fcge). }

