\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ad usum privatum collectum et in hanc formam redactum Anno dni MDCXLIV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Individuell zusammengestelltes Andachts- und Gebetbuch mit eingebundenen Kupferstichen.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Exercitium quotidianum, (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) exercitium animae devotae, (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) septem horae canonicae, (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) litaniae BMV, (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) litaniae sanctorum in feriis II. IV. VI., (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) preces nocturnae, (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) litaniae ad patronos speciales, (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) hymni de passione \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  8682. 19416, (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) meditationes ante communionem, (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) hymni de BMV, darunter AH 32 Nr. 136, AH 50 Nr. 323 II-III, AH 54 Nr. 250 (jeweils mit vielen Varianten), (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Rosarium BMV, (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) AH 41 Nr. IV,19, (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ludovicus Blosius\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Preculae piae ad BMV, Endologiae 1-6, Druck: Ingolstadt 1585 (VD 16: B 5766), S. 274-301, zum Autor: BBKL 1 Sp. 625 f. (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 F.W. Bautz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ), (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) commendationes quotidianae, (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ludovicus Blosius\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Endologiae ad Iesum, Ausz\u252 \'fcge (mit Varianten) aus Endologia 15 u. 23, Druck: s.o. S. 234-240. 271-273, (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) sertum BMV p. I-V, (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) orationes, (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) AH 50 Nr. 383 (Auszug), (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) orationes, (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) intonationes hymnorum et psalmorum, mit Noten, (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Jeremias Drexel\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Lacrimae aeternitati sacrae, Auszug aus: Nicetas seu triumphata incontinentia, Druck: M\u252 \'fcnchen 1624 (VD 17: 12:101269 G) S. 296-302, zum Autor: NDB 4, S. 119 f. (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 W. Kratz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ).}

