\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes (Heynlin) de Lapide}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Resolutorium (dubiorum circa celebrationem missarum occurentium)}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Kapitel 1-8, mit erg\u228 \'e4nzenden Randbemerkungen und (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) vertiefenden quaestiones/solutiones. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur Resolutorium misse. Capitulum primum de intensione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  collectorum et materia tractanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Officium quanto maius et dignius est tanto cum maiori cura atque diligencia exercendum est. Gravius enim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 circa hanc formam consecrationis vini occurrere possunt. Et pariformas habent etc. solutiones. Explicit libellus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Text um 2 Kapitel verk\u252 \'fcrzt gegen\u252 \'fcber Druck GW 7806 (Augsburg, Johann Froschauer ca. 1497). Zum Werk: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Messe S. 558 f.; insgesamt 44 Drucke des Textes bekannt, vgl. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 VL 3 Sp. 1213-1219 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 B. M. v. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 S\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 carpatetti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ). \endash  58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. }

