\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Meditatio de passione domini}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quo abiit \u8230 \'85 (Ct 5,17) Consuetudo est apud homines huius mundi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  quod amico mortuo ad domum defuncti conveniunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (nur Anfang \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Johannes de Capestrano, Sermo de passione), (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quo abiit \u8230 \'85 (Ct 5,17). Respondet Anselmus in persona Marie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 filius meus hac nocte et die hodierna novem vias abiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quantum ergo ad primam viam videlicet ad ortum querere potuit anima devota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Via 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Respondet mestissima mater: dilectus meus eundo de orto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 Mestissima mater respondere potuit: Dilectus meus ivit tertio ad Caipham et ductus esset in pretorium Pylati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 Respondere potuit mater mestissima: filius meus de domo Caiphe ivit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 eundo de pretorio respondere potuit mestissima mater: dilectus meus ivit quinto in domum Herodis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 Respondere potuit mater mestissima quod abiit in viam sextam cum magna incommoditate a domo Herodis ad domum Pylati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85, (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 Respondere potuit mestissima mater, quod dilectus meus abiit septimo de pretorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 Et respondere potuit: Audi o anima devota, ille quem diligit anima mea ivit ad montem Calvarie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 9\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  via \u8230 \'85 Respondere potuit mater mestissima ad sepulchrum ut ibi sepeliatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Clamemusque omnes corde devoto Ihesus, Ihesus, Ihesus Amen. Consumatus est 1531\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Die Meditation wird gegliedert in 9 Wege mit jeweils 6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 acta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ; neben den Hauptquellen (Bibel, Kirchenv\u228 \'e4ter) werden u.a. zitiert: \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ps.\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Anselmus \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Cantuariensis\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Beda, Bonaventura, Hrabanus \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Maurus\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Nicolaus de\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Lyra, Simon \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Fidati\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  de Cassia, Remigius \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Autissiodorensis\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

