\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Titelblatt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Continuatio omnium utriusque juris titulorum cum ipsarum rubricarum insertione. 1598.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ratio discendi iuris accomodata captui adolescentuli cuiusdam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 I. Ut omnium aliarum scientiarum, Ita et juris generalibus ad specialia facilius percipitur cognitio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Anleitung zum Studium des Corpus iuris, 27 Abschnitte, (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Continuatio omnium utriusque juris titulorum cum ipsarum rubricarum insertione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ius universum quo hodie communiter in foro utimur partim est Caesareum partim pontificium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85, (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) institutiones, (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) digesta, (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) codex, (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) novellae, (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) libri feudorum, (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) decretum Gratiani, (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) liber extra, (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) liber sextus, (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Clementinae, (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) extravagantes. Lehrbuch oder Vorlesungsnachschrift mit einf\u252 \'fchrenden Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen zum Corpus Iuris. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

