\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Decretum Gratiani versificatum cum glossis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (Text bricht ab nach C.22 q.2 c.14). Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Pauper et incultus contextus versibus erga}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  / Ad iubar hic metuit lumina ferre liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Tres partes habet iste liber, distinctio prime / nomina dat parti cum per centum sit et una \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) pars 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Humanum genus est duplice sub iure statutum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  / Nature morum Jus naturale vocatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) pars 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 []{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 it monachus precii puer a genitore soluti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  / nescius et crescens sit presbiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Cum falsum dicat mendax ut habetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Fortsetzung (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Nec mendax promissor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 fas dicere falsum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (Abbruch). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Initia carminum Nr. 13862. Beginn der 1. Glosse: (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Deficientibus canonibus judicet secundum leges Ex De novi operis nunciatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (X 5.32) \u8230 \'85 \endash  24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer (Wasserschaden). Verse mit Varianten gegen\u252 \'fcber der Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung (Prag UB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 I. B. 25}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , verzeichnet bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Die canonistischen Handschriften der Bibliotheken in Prag, (Abhandlungen der k\u246 \'f6niglichen b\u246 \'f6hmischen Gesellschaft der Wissenschaften 1868 Folge 6 Bd. 2), Prag 1869 S. 27).}

