\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes de Werdea}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Hieronymus de Mondsee)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Dicta in primam partem Grammaticae Alexandri de Villa Dei}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Kap. 1-7, ohne Prolog)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Rectis as es a dat declinatio \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Textbeginn Kommentar:}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Construe prima declinatio nominis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Expliciunt dicta Allexandri in prima parte per reverendum magistrum Johannem de Werdea. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Et sunt finita per me Johannem de Chiczpuchel tunc temporis scolarem alme Wime (lies: Wienne) universitatis sub anno domini M\u176 \'b0 1451 (!) infra horam 2am et 3am in vigilia purificationis beate Marie virginis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (1451 Feb. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 etc. Io. geisler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Text ohne Prolog. Zum Doctrinale und den verschiedenen Kommentaren: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Reichling\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Das Doctrinale des Alexander de Villa-Dei, Berlin 1893, S. LXII f. Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Wien \u214 \'d6NB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Cod. 5150}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (ehemals Melk), M\u252 \'fcnchen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Clm 16517}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 19664}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Tegernsee), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 19870}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Tegernsee); zu diesem Kommentar, der nach den erhaltenen Textzeugen besonders im Kreis der Melker Reformkl\u246 \'f6ster beliebt war, s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Gl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ckert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Hieronymus von Mondsee S. 104 f. u. 192 Nr. 1; zum Verfasser s. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 VL 4 Sp. 799-811 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 J. Stohlmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ). }

