\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Vegetius Renatus, Flavius}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De re militari}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Populus iubente domino Israheliticus libenter munera obtulit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ad fabrum tabernaculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incpiunt libri Vigecii Renati viri ilustris de re militari. Et sunt quatuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. Prooemium, (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) liber I, (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) liber II, (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) liber III, (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) liber IV (46 Kapitel, d.h. 4. u. 5. Buch zusammengefa\u223 \'dft)  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 quam vetus doctrina monstraverat. Et sic est finis huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 []\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Eplicit liber Vegecii etc. illustris viri de re militari, completus per me Nicolaum Vipech canonicum ecclesie beate Marie virginis extra muros Bambergensis. Anno domini Millesimo quadringetesimo tricesimoquinto, indictione XIII pontificatus domini nostri Eugenii quarti anno suo quarto XIIII die mensis iulii, hora vespera in Basilea tempore concilii anno quarto in habitacione Io\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 []\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sip\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 []\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ad vulpes in fo\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ro\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 piscium etc. anno meo LII.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Druck: Hain 15913-15914; Hs verzeichnet bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 C.R. Shrader\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , A Handlist of extant manuscripts containing the De re militari of Flavius Vegetius Renatus in: Scriptorium 33,2 (1979) S. 284, mit weiterer Lit. }

