\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Petrus de Crescentiis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Liber ruralium commodorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Ausz\u252 \'fcge, Buch 1 Kap. 1-5, Buch XI-XII. Widmungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Venerabili in Christo \u8230 \'85 Aymerico de Placencia sanctissimi ordinis fratrum predicatorum magistro dignissimo Suus Petrus de Crescenciis civis Bononiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipit liber Ruralium commodorum a Petro de Crescentiis cive Bon\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 oniensi\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  compilatus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Rubricae lib. I-XII, (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Widmungsbrief an Karl II.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Excellentissimo principi domino Karolo secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Cum ex virtute prudentie que inter bonum et malum caute discernit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 multiplicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Abbruch). (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber XI, (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber XII, (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 et rethibus diversis ac visco et similibus. Sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Ed.: Petrus de Crescentiis Ruralia commoda. Das Wissen des vollkommenen Landwirts um 1300, hg. v. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 W. Richter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Editiones Heidelbergenses 25-27. 30) Heidelberg 1995-2002, Bd. 1 S. 1-38,35 u. Bd. 3 S. 211-26. Zur \u220 \'dcL: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 L. Frati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Bibliografia dei manoscritti in: Pier de\rquote  Crescenzi (1233-1321). Studi e Documenti, Bologna 1933, S. 261 ff. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. }

