\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Felix [Hemmerlin}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Contra validos mendicantes}}\plain \f4\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Epistola ad Henricum ep. Constantiensem) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Reverendo in Christo patri et domino domino Henrico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 episcopo Constanciensi domino meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Felix Cantor Thuricensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Ex quo suscepti regiminis cura pastorem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Datum Thurei anno dni. M\u176 \'b0 quadringentesimo trigesimooctavo kal. Ianuarii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (1.1.1438)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  indictione prima. Incipit recapitulacio. Quia Beghardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Consilium. Ex quo autem per indirectum contra easdem Beghardos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 largitor omnium bonorum per infinita secula seculorum benedictus. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Druck: Hain 8424-8425. Zu Autor und \u220 \'dcL \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 VL 3 Sp. 994 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 K. Colberg\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ohne diese Hs).\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1  \u8213 \'af 209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

