\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ps.\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 :\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De exercitiis discretis devotorum simplicium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Text mit Umstellungen, K\u252 \'fcrzungen und Einsch\u252 \'fcben (Thomas a Kempis). Als Vorlage der Abschrift k\u246 \'f6nnte ein von der Stra\u223 \'dfburger Ausgabe (GW 10714) abh\u228 \'e4ngiger Druck gedient haben, der auch den Text der Einsch\u252 \'fcbe (s.u.) bietet. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Deus vult ut sit racionabile obsequium nostrum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Kapitel 1-2), (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio eiusdem de remediis contra malas cogitationes. Cum igitur cogitatio mala \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85, (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio de malarum cogitacionum causis atque remediis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio eiusdem qualiter et quare orandum sit spiritu sine imaginibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio et consolacio officialium qui circa exteriora occupantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Druck: Opera omnia 3, Sp. 605 f. 610-616. 608-610. 607-608. \plain \f4\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Einsch\u252 \'fcbe: (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: Epistolae\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio de custodia habenda ad seipsum et est quasi formula honeste et circumspecte vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 V]ideas frater quomodo caute ambules}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 concede amorem. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Schlu\u223 \'df abweichend vom Druck), (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio eiusdem incitativa ad spiritualem profectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Prochdolor quamplures hodie reperiuntur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 manna absconditum,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Informacio eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 pro confortatione alicuius temptati sive tribulati. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Suscipiamus de manu dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 convalescamus in ipso. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Epistola eiusdem de conversione et perseverantia in bono proposito. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Sit dominus noster ex hinc }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 concedat vitam eternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Druck: Opera omnia 3, Sp. 750 f. 748-750. 752-754. 754-756. }

