\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Psalmi VII. vulgo poenitentiales hic quadrifariam: I. Vulgata editione a Gerardo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 [lies: Gilberto]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Genebrardo etc. emendata, II. Subiecta mox Joannis Campensis versione non paulo magis latina, III. Cum eiusdem Paraphrasi \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 brevi et perspicua, IIII. Ac demum alia pleniori ad excursus animi accommodata atque ex variis probatis paraphrasis \u8230 \'85 concinnata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Oratio auctoris, (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 6, (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 31, (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 37, (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 50, (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 101, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 129, (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 142. Fortsetzung der Expositio: (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) ps. 90, (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Finis in dominica XV. P\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ost\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  t\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 rinitat\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 is Anno MDXCVIII, XXIII. sextilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (23. August 1598), (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 psalmus encomiasticus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (Ps. 102). Text weitgehend \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit 8\u176 \'b0 Cod 90,5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Seitengestaltung jedoch abweichend (zu vermuten ist eine gemeinsame Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr 8\u176 \'b0 Cod 90 u. 217); Siglen weisen au\u223 \'dferdem auf Werke u.a. von: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 F\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ranciscus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Vat\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ablus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 F\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ranciscus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Titel\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 mannus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Cor\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 nelius\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Jans\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 enius\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Rob\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ertus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 G\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 oullet?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 MAF \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 A\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 rias?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 M\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ontanus?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Orationes (gg. die 7 Tods\u252 \'fcnden). \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Psalterium turcicum id est Ex sacris Psalmis desumptae et tempori belli Turcici accommodatae preces atque in septenos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 dies distribulatae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Aufbau: (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Vier christliche andechtige gebet zuo Got wider den Bluetgirigen Tyrannen und christlichen Namens Erbfeind, den T\u252 \'fcrggen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Teildruck: Augsburg 1566 = VD 16: ZV 4737), (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Introitus, (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) f\u252 \'fcr jeden Tag 3 (aus Einzelversen zusammengestellte) Psalmen u. 3 Gebete, f\u252 \'fcr den 7. Tag zus\u228 \'e4tzlich 3 lectiones, (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Schlu\u223 \'dfgebet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ein gebet f\u252 \'fcr den gemainen stand der christenheit zue diser betr\u252 \'fcebten zeit wider beide feind T\u252 \'fcrggen und secten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . }

