\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Collectanea ex tota Biblia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Kurze Exzerpte aus biblischen B\u252 \'fcchern; Reihenfolge entspricht nur tw. der kanonischen Ordnung. (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Index. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 NT: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Evangelia secundum Matthaeum, (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Iohannem, (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Marcum, (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Lucam, (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Anno dni 1526 jar feria secunda post palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 M. L. O. Z. V. B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b, (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Epistulae Pauli,  (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Finitum et scriptum per me Mathiam Loeser in Baiersried in octava ascensionis dni 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Actus apostolorum, (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Epistulae canonicae septem. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 AT: (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber psalmorum, (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Scriptum per me Mathiam Loeser vicarium in Bairsried sabatho in octava pentechostes Anno dni 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber sapientiae, (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Hiob, (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Ecclesiastes, (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber proverbiorum, (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Cantica canticorum, (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber sapientiae. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 NT: (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Apocalypsis Iohannis apostoli\plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 . \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  AT: (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber Iesu filii Sirach, (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Mathias Loeser 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber Tobiae, (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Libri Machabeorum I/II, (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Scriptum per me Mathiam Loeser Anno dni 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber 12 prophetarum, (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Prophetae, (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Scriptum et finitum in die Barnabe apostoli anno dni 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Libri Moysis, (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Genesis, (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 finis genesis 1526\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Exodus, (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 In octava Petri et Pauli appl. 1526 jar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Leviticus, (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Numeri, (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Deuteronomium, (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Libri prophetales, (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Josua, (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber iudicum, (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Ruth, (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Samuel I/II = Regum I/II, (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Malachim I/II = Regum III/IV, (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Paralipomenon I/II. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Apocryphae: (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Oratio Manasse. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 AT: (262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Libri Ezrae I-II. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Apocryphae: (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Liber Ezrae IV, (276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Hec scripta sunt per me, Mathiam Loeser vicarium in Bairsried, et collecta ex libris Biblie veteris ac novi testamenti. Anno dni milesimo quingentesimo vicesimo sexto anno, in die Crispini et Crispiniani martyrum octavo idus octobris mense etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (8.10.1526). \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 AT: Libri prophetales, (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Judith, (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Esther, (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : Et sic est finis 1526 M. L. V. B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .\plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1  \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

