\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Sammlung f\u252 \'fcr den priesterlichen Gebrauch, zusammengetragen aus verschiedenen Drucken. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Litaniae contra tempestates e libello Dilinge impresso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (VD 16 n.n.), (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) orationes contra tempestates, darunter (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) collecta de 14 auxiliatoribus, (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Johannes Trithemius, Oratio contra tonitrua et aeris tempestates, (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) oratio b. Cypriani, (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 contra tempestates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ex agenda Augustana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Barbaragebete, darunter AH 55 Nr. 79, (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Contra tempestates. Exorcismus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ex breviario Romano impresso Burgis in Hispania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Benedictiones contra aves, vermes, mures, locustas vel alia animalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ex sacerdotali romano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Druck der Gebete 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 :  Piae aliquot precationes contra aereas tempestates \u8230 \'85, Tegernsee 1576 (VD 16: P 2548) S. 2\plai