\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 [Caeremoniae monasterii ss. Udalrici et Afrae]}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Einzelkapitel ohne klare inhaltliche Linie; einzelne Passagen sind in den Melker Consuetudines von 1460 wiederzufinden. (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Forma peticionis professorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Venerabilis pater et honorabiles patres ceterique in Christi dilecti, hec sancta conversacio et observancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 vite regularis que iam hic tenetur placet michi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ..., (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur modus professionis novicii \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ego frater N ad honorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  ..., (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ad nomen virginis\plain \f5\i\lang1024\fs22\cf1  s. Marie et sanctorum \u366 \'d9dalrici et Afre \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  In presentia \u8230 \'85 domini Johannis abbatis huius monasterii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Erkennbare Verwandtschaft mit den Melker Consuetudines, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 CCM 2 S.149 Z.10 - S.155 Z. 2. (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De mandato pauperum in cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ad mandatum fratrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Absolutiones in matutinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Trina oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De confessione\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ad dandam disciplinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ad introducendam mulierem post partum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ad introducendam sponsam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b, (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipit ordo curie romane ad benedicendam mensam per totum annum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De capitulo celebrando per totum annum\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Incipiuntur absoluciones de sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur benedictio hospitis nostri ordinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b, (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur modus confitendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b mit Absolutionsformeln (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Henricus Heinbuche de Langenstein zugeschrieben, (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur ad mandatum hospitum supervenientium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur capitulum XX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  conversorum prius neglegtum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Item wann sy s\u246 \'f6llen das heylig sacrament enphahen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Nachtrag zu 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ), (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur alia peticio pro fratribus manere volentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Pro fratribus exire volentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur de tempore medio inter matutinum et primam etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b vgl. Melker consuetudines, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCM 2 S. 38-39 Z.9, (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Item casus reservati abbati sunt isti etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sequitur de modo psallendi tempore divini officii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b vgl. Melker consuetudines ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Angerer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  CCM 2 S. 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  S. 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ; S. 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9-12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De modo disciplinam dandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (Abbruch am Anfang des Kapitels). \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

