tolus Jacobus quem hodierne dominice in lectione missali audivimus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 De sermonis materia de qua predicandum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Pane verbi dei cibandus est spiritus sicut caro pascitur pane}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 quibus datur occasio fodiatur. Explicit vallis salinarum de fossione salis quo docentis sermo condiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Zum Verfasser: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 VL 5 Sp. 1090-1104, zum Werk (mit Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung) ebd. Sp. 1096. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Nachtrag, im Autograph des Johannes Keck (M\u252 \'fcnchen BSB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Clm 19606}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , 248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) nicht enthalten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Item excusacio circa inicium sermonis. Quomodo ego tantillus et elingwis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 salutacione gabrielica dicens Ave Maria etc\plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 . \u8213 \'af 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. }

