\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 <Johannes Honorius Cubitensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Epitomata> super novem libros Valerii Maximi de dictis factisque memorabilibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Exzerpte (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Valerius Maximus cives\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (!) romanus de patricio genere natus omnem pueritiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 nihil potest afferi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Valerii Maximi dictorum et factorum memorabilium rubrice\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Sachregister \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Rerum et verborum Index in V.M.\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Romani non ethrusca consuetudine solum sed eciam maiorum suorum ritu sacrificare consueverunt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Erg\u228 \'e4nzender Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Decem principum filios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 romani ad tuscos miserunt ad venerem ibi colendam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 regni penas dare coegit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus einem Druck (VD16: V 126-132) mit umfangreichen Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen, f\u252 \'fcr die sich bisher keine Vorlage ermitteln lie\u223 \'df. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. }

