caps\lang1033\fs22 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  RB\~2, 2249; Druck: B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Thesaurus anecdotorum novissimus 2, Augsburg 1721, Sp. 23-38. Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 8\u176 \'b0 Cod  21}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ,203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

