\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De excommunicatione}}\plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  anonyme Kompilation aus 4 Teilen. 1. Notae de excommunicatione maiori: (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Nomine censure ecclesiastice intelligitur sententia excommunicationis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , interdicti et suspensionis. Interdicti a prohibicione sacramentorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 pro diversis culpis diversis excommunicatur excommunicationibus vel eciam cum a diversis episcopis excommunicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . Autorit\u228 \'e4ten: Augustinus, Bonaventura, Thomas von Aquin, Bibel\plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 . \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 2. Casus de excommunicatione: (321\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quicumque in clericum sive conversum vel aliam personam ecclesiasticam temere violenter iniecit  manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (332\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Bezug auf Florenz. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 3. Consilium: (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1463 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Determinatio cuiusdam doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quesivit vestra paternitas primo Si iniciens manus violentes ac temerarias in clericum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1   \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Et hec de predictis ex parvitate mei ingenii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 4. Notae de peccato mortali: (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Solum peccatum mortale excludit post baptismum a communitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Nota quod homo possit informare conscienciam suam ut dicit Petrus de Palude \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ut excommunicatio a jure incurreretur nisi propter peccatum mortale. hec Rich\plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ?\plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 1466\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . }

