\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Manuale Confessorum}}\plain \f4\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Kompilation aus verschiedenen Quellen. (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Orationes de peccatis, (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Confessiones: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Item tali modo possit quis confiteri de cogitationibus viciosis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8230 \'85, (343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Notae de confessione: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Notandum quod cum communem evagacionem patitur in omnibus aliquando accidit ex infirmitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Infomatio simplicium confessionis quottidiane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Confessiones: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Premissa ergo diligenti discussione et examinatione tue conscientie de peccatis perpetratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, Benedictiones: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Pro certo scias te esse debitorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Notae de viciis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Vana gloria vocatur quando aliquis inordinate desiderat videri vel reputari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (371\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Manuale de quotidianis peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ego miser/magnus reus peccator confiteor \u8230 \'85, Et ibi possunt dici speciales negligencie admisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 aliis actibus conventualibus se absentavit. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,  (374\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quottidiana confessio potest fieri de hiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (375\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Casus in quibus opportet iterare confessionem \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85ut quando homo commiscetur bestie etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Et sic est finis anno domini 1459 in die s. Vitalis et Agricole}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . (376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Notae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Item vicia summo studio et summa diligentia sunt cavenda ... 1459\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .}

