\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Thascius Caecilius Cyprianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Opera}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Sehr kurze Exzerpte; als Vorlage l\u228 \'e4\u223 \'dft sich die von Erasmus von Roterdam bearbeitete Druckausgabe Basel (Joh. Froben 1520/1521 /1525, VD16: C 6508/6509/6512) ermitteln, die im Gegensatz zu den Inkunabel-Ausgaben (GW 7883-7887) alle Texte der Hs umfa\u223 \'dft und in nahezu identischer Reihenfolge darbietet. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Epistolarum libri 1-4, (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Contra Demetrianum, (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De habitu virginum, (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De simplicitate prelatorum, (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De idolorum varietate, (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De elemosyna, (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De zelo et livore, (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De bono patientiae, (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De mortalitate, (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De lapsis, (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De oratione dominica, (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) De exhortatione martyrii, (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Ad Iubaianum de haereticis baptizandis, (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Ad Pompeium contra epistolam Stephani, (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ps.\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Cyprianus, De singularitate clericorum, (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Tyrannius Rufinus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Expositio in symbolum apostolorum, (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ernaldus Bonaevallis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , De cardinalibus operibus Christi, (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Cyprianus, De laude martyrii, (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Register. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer.}

