\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 :\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Liber de imitatione Christi}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (lib. I-IV)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Qui sequitur me non ambulat in tenebris dicit dominus. Hec sunt verba Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 -\u8230 \'85 (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 dirige per viam pacis ad patriam perpetue claritatis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Explicit liber tertius \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 lies: quartus\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  de imitacione domini nostri Jhesu Christi et interne consolacionis etc alia plura per dominum prepositum in Korze \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  cuius nomen sit in libro vite amen. Anno domini MCCCCL\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .  (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula lib. 1-4 (nachtr\u228 \'e4glich eingef\u252 \'fcgt). \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  leer. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Text mit kleineren Abweichungen (Varianten, Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung) gegen\u252 \'fcber der Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Delaiss\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  S. 4-404; mehrere Einsch\u252 \'fcbe im 1. u. 2. Buch: (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Gebet: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 O rex glorie, rex regum \u8230 \'85 gratior tibi quod propter nos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Gebet: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 O sancta mater domini nostri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Sermo (Auszug): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Sobrie et iuste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Tt 2,12-13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 In hiis tribus debet homo ordinatus esse \u8230 \'85 data eius custodiamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Factum est silentium in celo dum draco committeret bellum et Michael pugnavit cum eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Ps. Beda: De XV signis ante diem iudicii\plain \f3\lang1024\fs22\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Quindecim dierum spacium. Quindecim signa ante diem judicii invenit Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 mit Abweichungen gegen\u252 \'fcber Druck: PL 94,555, (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Gebet: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Sanctissima et gloriosissima et piissima virgo sancta Maria, Ego indignus peccator Conr[adus?] tibi committo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  esse meum nosse posse vivere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85 vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , Livres d\rquote heures 2 S. 278.}

