ng1033\fs22\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) Tabula (Multiplikationstabelle, bis 10x20). \plain \f3\lang1032\fs22\cf1 \u8213 \'af \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Teiledition (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 -162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Kaunzner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  S. 29-32. }

