\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Alphabetarium divini amoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad honorem omnipotentis dei aliquos modos et vias}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85, (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 A timore servili procedit filialis. Plures enim incipiunt [statt: incipientes] declinare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sit adiutor tuus, protector director et finis Amen \u8230 \'85 Qui hoc legerit oret pro ordine carthusiensium ex quorum fonte licet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  procedunt \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Randbemerkung (tw. abgeschnitten): \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 secundum alios tractatulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 venerabilis magistri Johannis Gerson cancellarii parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Abschrift nach Vorlage: M\u252 \'fcnchen BSB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Clm 4423}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ,191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; kleinere Abweichungen gegen\u252 \'fcber \plain \f2\lang1032\fs22 Druck: GW 1554. \u8213 \'af Die Verfasserfrage (Nikolaus K\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u228 \'e4mpf, Johannes Gerson, Nikolaus de Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, oder Johannes Nider ?) ist ungekl\u228 \'e4rt s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 D. D. Martin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , The Writings of Nikolaus Kempf of Strassburg, in: Die Kart\u228 \'e4user in \u214 \'d6sterreich 1, Salzburg 1980, 125-154, bes. S. 153. }

