\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hieronymus de Mondsee}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De contemplatione dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Auszug, c.22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur de quibusdam modis et doctrinis specialibus quibus homo in orando aut psallendo devocionem acquirere potest ex tractatulo magistri Jeronimi de Werdea monasterio Lunelacensi professo etc. Qui tractatus sic incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Elevamini porte eternales Psalmo 23o (Ps 23,7) processum audientis per modum dyalogi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  etc. Discipulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Magister honorande, queso ut michi quasdam doctrinas dare velis \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 ut id faceres inspiravit domino nostro Jhesu Christo cui sit laus, honor et gloria in secula seculorum Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Abschrift von Hs M\u252 \'fcnchen BSB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Clm 4423}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; zum Verf.: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 VL 4, Sp. 799 ff. (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 J. Stohlmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ).}

